340 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E (Rabbi Edward Benjamin, who has been involved with Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim since its inception, graduated from Hillel Yeshiva High School and attended Yeshivat Torah Shraga for a year. He then attended and graduated CUNY with a BA degree in Philosophy and Jewish Studies while attending the Sephardic Rabbinical College as a part time student. While working in Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim, Rabbi Benjamin is also pursuing semikha from the Chief Rabbinate in Israel and has, to date, passed the rabbinic exams on abelut, nidda, and huppa vkiddushin. He also holds a master's degree in Jewish Education from Yeshiva University's Azrieli School of Jewish Education.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
