371 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (The school year at the yeshivah is coming to an end. Another year of Torah, of growth, of friendship, and of personal and spiritual development in Jerusalem.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
372 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (But the truth is, this was not just another year.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
373 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (This was a year in which the students of the yeshivah studied Torah in a country at war. A year in which news from the front lines became an inseparable part of daily life. A year in which soldiers went out to battle, families lived with constant worry, and an entire nation underwent profound upheaval. And amid all this, the students continued to grow.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
374 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (Perhaps that was the point that moved me most deeply this year: to see young men who could easily have been swept into fear, confusion, or indifference, yet instead chose to deepen their learning, strengthen their faith, refine their characters, take responsibility, and connect even more deeply to the Jewish people and the Land of Israel.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
375 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (It was specifically through this complex period that the true strength of this generation was revealed.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
376 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (We saw students who prayed differently. Learned differently. Listened differently.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
377 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (They asked deeper questions about their mission, their responsibility, and the meaning of their lives.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
378 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (War reveals a person to himself. And this year, we were privileged to witness many students in the yeshiva become more mature, more serious, and more committed to the values by which they live.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
379 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (This year, the bet midrash was not disconnected from reality - it was a response to reality.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (In days when the people of Israel were fighting for their very existence, Torah took on a more tangible meaning. Not as theory, but as a life force. As a source of faith, stability, identity, and hope.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
