/T (Perashat Behalotekha teaches us many lessons, but one specific lesson is that everyone has a role in why Hashem put them here. We see throughout the parasha how jobs and responsibilities were distributed among so many different people, and that shows us one important idea: every person has a specific role in serving Hashem.)
/E (Perashat Behalotekha teaches us many lessons, but one specific lesson is that everyone has a role in why Hashem put them here. We see throughout the parasha how jobs and responsibilities were distributed among so many different people, and that shows us one important idea: every person has a specific role in serving Hashem.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
