491 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 232 0 R
/E (I remember him telling us that he really saw the way that Robert came home, a new person, a different person, more focused, knowing what he wants in life. And he said that he wanted that as well so we sent him. And, of course, there was no question that it was Moreshet or nothing. He went and really had the best time. When he went it was actually the COVID year, so it was a very hard year but it was phenomenal. Different ways than Robert's year, but also phenomenal for him. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
492 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 232 0 R
/E (MM: What do you mean different?)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
493 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 232 0 R
/E (TF: His character, his learning, because it was a very different year. They couldn't go out as much. When they got there, they had to quarantine for 3 weeks. They learned from it. It made them stronger. Just that alone made such a big difference. He became more mature, more independent. Even his relationships with his friends grew and changed. He connected with Rabbi Tessler until today - how many years later? The bond that my son has with the rabbi is something incredible. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
