2232 0 obj
<<
/Title (There is something in the air in Eres Yisrael that you cannot find anywhere else in the world. I've been here many times before, but nothing compares to actually living here. The moment you step off the plane, you feel it. A warmth, a pull, a sense that this is exactly where you are supposed to be. It's something you can only understand by being here.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2219 0 R
/Next 2244 0 R
>>
