2244 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Yeshivah takes us on hikes throughout the year, and walking through this land with my own two feet made me understand something I never could have from just a visit. The land has a heartbeat. You feel it beneath you, around you, in the air you breathe. It's unlike anything I've ever experienced, and I don't think I'll ever stop being grateful for the year that I had.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2219 0 R
/Prev 2232 0 R
/Next 2251 0 R
>>
endobj
