2251 0 obj
<<
/Title (Some of my favorite memories are the simplest ones. Across the street from us is Gan Saker, a park where we'd play frisbee, go for runs, and just be together. One night after night seder, we brought a speaker to the park and started playing Hebrew music. Everyone was laughing and having a good time, and I thought: I cannot believe this is my life right now. That moment is one I will carry forever.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2219 0 R
/Prev 2244 0 R
/Next 2257 0 R
>>
endobj
2252 0 obj
<<
/Title (I came here as one person and I'm leaving another. I know that because when I went home for Pesah, I wanted to continue the habits that I built in school. That might sound small, but for me it was everything. This land, this year, these boys changed me. And no matter where I go from here, Eres Yisrael will always feel like home.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2219 0 R
/Prev 2257 0 R
/Next 2245 0 R
>>
endobj
